---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
    <main>
        <h1>Cybersécurité</h1>
        <p>Mon journal d'apprentissage de la sécurité offensive et défensive, de TryHackMe à OverTheWire.</p>

        <details open>
            <summary>Récapitulatifs Vizion (notes de cours)</summary>
            <ul class="article-list">
                <li><a href="/cybersecurite/vizion-1-reseaux">Vizion 1 — Réseaux : OSI, TCP/UDP, intermédiaires</a></li>
            </ul>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>OverTheWire</summary>
            <ul class="article-list">
                <li><em>Article à venir : Bandit — Ma progression niveau par niveau</em></li>
            </ul>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>TryHackMe</summary>
            <ul class="article-list">
                <li><em>Aucun article publié pour l'instant.</em></li>
            </ul>
        </details>
    </main>
</Layout>

<style>
    main { margin: auto; padding: 1rem; width: 1200px; max-width: calc(100% - 2rem); }

    details {
        background: #f4f4f4;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        border: 1px solid #ddd;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    summary {
        padding: 1rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-weight: bold;
        background-color: #eee;
        position: relative;
        list-style: none;
    }

    summary:hover { background-color: #e2e2e2; }
    summary::after { content: '+'; position: absolute; right: 20px; font-weight: bold; }
    details[open] summary::after { content: '-'; }

    .article-list { padding: 1rem 2rem; margin: 0; }
    .article-list li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .article-list a { text-decoration: none; color: #333; }
    .article-list a:hover { color: #5a41dc; text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
